# r1113 chunk 3, boot CO1 (then c3_co2.qb on the same OUT): SQ-CMV-02, Creative Common alone. Group B (cc_only_srv.sh
# builds on prep_srv B).
# Server: bash tools/scratch_query/cc_only_srv.sh OUT_CO c3co alone
#   (Common + KubeJS, Rhino, Architectury + perfBot; empty kubejs/ apart from zq, no config/ or defaultconfigs/)
pace 1

## SQ-CMV-02 | Common alone boots, reloads clean; no class or mixin error; no script error
bootexpect Done \(
bootreject NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
> reload
waitlog Reloading!|reload 60
sleep 15
shell cat logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -E "\[ERROR\]" | head -5; test "$(cat logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log | grep -cE "\[ERROR\]")" = 0
reject NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException
look stop is clean (the runner's stop: no exception after "Stopping server" in latest.log). SQ-CCO-13 (r1107cco) passed the same set on the 11-07 jar; this is the 11-12 jar
